--------------------------------------------------

This is one of the most important parts of your assessment.

Ask Copilot:

"Find the exact code responsible for anomaly detection.

Tell me:

- file name
- function/class
- input
- output
- detection logic/model
- how an anomaly is represented

Then tell me the exact terminal command to run ONLY the anomaly detection portion.

Do not modify anything."

Run it.

You want to actually see something like:

Metric: CPU
Value: ...
Status: NORMAL

and potentially:

Metric: CPU
Value: ...
Status: ANOMALY

Record the output.


