17. MAKE YOUR README SOUND HUMAN
--------------------------------------------------

Instead of:

"The system successfully demonstrates a robust and scalable AIOps pipeline."

Write:

"I first ran the existing workflow to understand how an operational metric moves through the system. The anomaly detector identifies unusual values and generates an event, which is then passed to the producer and consumer before the final AIOps processing."

