19. ONE VERY USEFUL COPILOT RULE
--------------------------------------------------

Throughout the assessment, use this pattern:

FIRST ASK:

"Explain what's happening. Don't change anything."

Then:

"Identify the root cause."

Then:

"Suggest the minimal fix."

Then:

"Apply only that fix."

Then:

"Show me the diff."

Then:

"Tell me how to validate it."

Then you run the validation.

This keeps you in control and makes it much easier to explain your work if the evaluator asks questions.


